# Built vector index and runtime audit output. Both are regenerated on demand --
# data/chroma_db by HistoricalVectorStore._ensure_seed_data() (and the directory
# by src/config.py's mkdir), data/decision_log.jsonl by the pipeline's audit
# writer. They were tracked until the hardening pass, which meant every eval run
# produced a dirty working tree and a diff of binary index pages. History is
# deliberately NOT rewritten: the files leave the index going forward, the old
# commits keep them.
data/chroma_db/
data/decision_log.jsonl
